# Agent Protocol — line-ending and encoding policy (D9)
# Ensures .sh files always check out with LF (even on Windows),
# so bash execution and lint-encoding.sh gates stay green.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.mdc text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
